---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="How It Was — Know what condition it was in" description="A guided way to document an item's condition before it changes hands, and compare it when it returns or arrives.">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> THE CONDITION, ON RECORD</div>
      <h1>Know how it was<br/><em>when it left your hands.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">A car collected for transport. Equipment lent out. Something valuable sent away. Document its condition while the handover is happening, so you have a clear record to come back to.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="/vehicle-transport/">Try the vehicle walkthrough <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
      <p class="microcopy">Browser-based · No account needed for the preview</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a condition record"><div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="record-card"><div class="record-head"><span>CONDITION RECORD</span><span class="record-id">01 / 02</span></div><div class="car-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 440 210" role="img"><path d="M50 139 78 89q13-22 40-26l144-9q40-2 63 25l39 47 35 12v35H43v-19q0-11 7-15Z" fill="#d6dbd0" stroke="#183933" stroke-width="3"/><path d="m105 88 17-18 136-8q30-1 49 18l26 35H87Z" fill="#ecf1e9" stroke="#183933" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M203 65v50M44 145h353" fill="none" stroke="#183933" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="112" cy="174" r="25" fill="#183933"/><circle cx="112" cy="174" r="12" fill="#f7f4ed"/><circle cx="323" cy="174" r="25" fill="#183933"/><circle cx="323" cy="174" r="12" fill="#f7f4ed"/></svg></div><div class="record-rule"></div><div class="record-row"><span>FRONT · LEFT · REAR · RIGHT</span><strong>Documented</strong></div><div class="record-row"><span>EXISTING MARKS</span><strong>Noted</strong></div><div class="record-footer"><span class="tiny-sun">✳</span> A moment worth keeping.</div></div><span class="art-caption">BEFORE IT CHANGES HANDS</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="statement"><div class="wrap statement-inner"><span class="section-index">01 / THE IDEA</span><p>Photos scattered through your camera roll are easy to forget. <strong>A guided condition record gives them context.</strong></p></div></section>
  <section class="section wrap" id="how-it-works"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-index">02 / HOW IT WORKS</span><h2>Take a closer look<br/>before you let go.</h2><p>We guide you through what to capture, while the item is still with you.</p></div><div class="steps-grid"><article><span class="step-num">01</span><div class="step-icon">□</div><h3>Identify it</h3><p>Add the details that distinguish your vehicle or item from another.</p></article><article><span class="step-num">02</span><div class="step-icon">◎</div><h3>Walk around it</h3><p>Follow a short photo guide and note any existing scratches, marks or missing parts.</p></article><article><span class="step-num">03</span><div class="step-icon">≡</div><h3>Review your record</h3><p>See the photos and notes together before the handover. A later arrival record can show what changed.</p></article></div><p class="preview-note">The walkthrough is an early preview. Draft photos stay on this device; permanent storage and sealed records are still in development.</p></section>
  <section class="uses-section" id="uses"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-index">03 / WHEN IT MATTERS</span><h2>For the moments<br/>you hand it over.</h2></div><div class="uses-grid"><a class="use-card featured" href="/vehicle-transport/"><span>01 / AVAILABLE TO TRY</span><h3>Vehicle transport</h3><p>Document your car before a transporter collects it.</p><b>Explore the walkthrough ↗</b></a><div class="use-card"><span>02 / PLANNED</span><h3>Valuable items</h3><p>Record contents and condition before a courier or repairer takes possession.</p></div><div class="use-card"><span>03 / PLANNED</span><h3>Equipment handover</h3><p>Keep track of marks, accessories and condition when something is lent or hired out.</p></div><div class="use-card"><span>04 / TO EXPLORE</span><h3>Rental move-in</h3><p>Capture a property's condition when you receive the keys.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="closing wrap"><span class="section-index">START WITH A VEHICLE</span><h2>The best time to document it<br/>is while it’s still in front of you.</h2><a class="button button-dark" href="/vehicle-transport/">Try the guided walkthrough <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</Base>
